  "step_by_step_reasoning": "The architecture shows a real-time clickstream processing and search suggestion pipeline. Users generate clickstream data on mobile devices, streaming into Kinesis Data Streams and analyzed via Kinesis Data Analytics. Filtered search events pass to a secondary Kinesis Data Stream and are processed by a Transformer Lambda function querying an external Search API before writing to DocumentDB. On a schedule, a Producer Lambda reads from DocumentDB, checks stock via an Inventory API, and writes suggestions to Redis ElastiCache, which serves the frontend Search API.",
